/Title (Student mental health has become a growing concern worldwide. Family environment is believed to be one of the key factors influencing students' emotional well-being. In this project, we analyze the Student Depression Dataset to investigate whether there is a significant difference in depression rates between students with and without a family history of mental illness. The goal is to generate insights that can help educational institutions provide better mental health support for students.)
